License: GPL-3
Comment: Fluent-kde (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Fluent-kde), pinned in
 upstream.json and checksum-verified at build time. tools/fluent.py derives
 the VeltOS Kvantum style, Aurorae window decorations, Plasma desktop themes
 and colour schemes from it: accent colour replaced, logos of other
 projects removed, settings adjusted. The Kvantum theme is based on
 KvAdapta by Tsu Jan.

